        <p class="text-2xl font-medium text-gray-900 mb-8 italic">
          Most people searching for a LIVESTRONG treadmill already have one, or are looking at one on
          a resale site, and want to know whether it is any good, where to find a part or manual, and
          whether the brand still exists. The short version: these were real, reasonably well-built
          home treadmills from Johnson Health Tech, a large manufacturer that still makes treadmills, sold under a
